<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CENBANK DRAINS ONE-WEEK FUNDS, AVG 44.93 PCT.</title>
<headline>CZECH CENBANK DRAINS ONE-WEEK FUNDS, AVG 44.93 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank said on Wednesday that average yield in a reverse repo tender offering to drain one-week funds from the market was 44.93 percent.</p>
<p>No total volume of the accepted transactions was released.</p>
<p>All bids at the maximum accepted yield of 45 percent were accepted, while the minimum accepted yield was 44 percent, the bank said.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
